      "audio": "5_Chapter_1.wav",
      "speaker": "agent",
      "name": "Larry",
      "voiceId": "pgXLagTlUQcy1LT68JCe",
      "text": "Black's a6 bishop is their bad piece, so trading it off would help them. On c2 my bishop still aims at h7 for a later Qd3.",
