      "speaker": "agent",
      "name": "Larry",
      "voiceId": "pgXLagTlUQcy1LT68JCe",
      "text": "Nb3 adds pressure on c5 and the loose a5 pawn. If black pushes c4, the knight lands on a great d4 square.",
