      "audio": "7_Chapter_1.wav",
      "speaker": "agent",
      "name": "Larry",
      "voiceId": "pgXLagTlUQcy1LT68JCe",
      "text": "Moving the knight off b3 frees the c2 bishop's diagonal, so Bxa4 would come with check against the e8 king.",
