      "audio": "8_Chapter_1.wav",
      "speaker": "agent",
      "name": "Larry",
      "voiceId": "pgXLagTlUQcy1LT68JCe",
      "text": "I'm a pawn up now. Next I'll pin that d7 knight against the king, since Black can't castle out of it yet. Didn't work. My own bishop on c2 blocks that diagonal. A bit embarrassing. Plan B: send the knight to b3 to hit c5.",
