      "speaker": "agent",
      "name": "Larry",
      "voiceId": "pgXLagTlUQcy1LT68JCe",
      "text": "Nothing defended c3, so Rxc3 was the threat. Qd2 covers c3 and backs up the f4 bishop too.",
