      "name": "Larry",
      "voiceId": "pgXLagTlUQcy1LT68JCe",
      "text": "Bd1 hits g4, which nothing defends, and clears the c-file. Next, a rook on c1 would line up on the c6 bishop with the queen sitting right behind it.",
