      "speaker": "agent",
      "name": "Larry",
      "voiceId": "pgXLagTlUQcy1LT68JCe",
      "text": "Taking with the f-pawn opens the f-file toward f7 and keeps Black's h8 rook off an open h-file aimed at my king.",
