      "speaker": "agent",
      "name": "Larry",
      "voiceId": "pgXLagTlUQcy1LT68JCe",
      "text": "With the knight gone from g8, only the rook guards h6, and my queen sees h6 through e3-f4-g5. Rxh6 Qxh6 would win the exchange, and the queen still covers d4.",
