      "speaker": "agent",
      "name": "Larry",
      "voiceId": "pgXLagTlUQcy1LT68JCe",
      "text": "The knight and queen were both hitting g4 and nothing defended it. On e2 the bishop is safe and covers d3, f3 and f1 near my king.",
